[Music]  two and a half years ago one of the most  legendary video game characters in pop  culture made his big screen debut sonic  the hedgehog since the blue hedgehog  wearing sneakers is already running  towards his third movie appearance it's  about time to present you an original  about sonic the hedgehog 3. in this  original episode you will learn  everything about cast crew production  and theories regarding the plot which so  far is still largely unknown before we  start we would like to point out that  there is an imminent risk of spoilers  for sonic the hedgehog one and two and  wish you lots of fun with our new video  before moving on to the potential  storyline of part three after the events  of 2020 sonic the hedgehog the world is  all right for sonic maddie and tom for  the moment as dr robotnik has been  banished to a distant mushroom-like  planet through a portal ring a few  months pass and sonic now tries to make  himself useful to the citizens with his  superhero powers before tom and maddie  fly to hawaii to attend the wedding of  maddie's sister and leave sonic alone  there is a piece of advice from tom to  sonic he should have patience after all  his powers would be needed sooner or  later and as if tom had guessed it  shortly after saying goodbye to his  foster parents sonic is attacked by the  returned robotnik and his new ally this  is knuckles who driven by the search for  the master emerald has sided with  robotnik except for him all the members  of his echidna tribe are extinct thus he  sees it as his calling to come into  possession of this ancient and powerful  relic fortunately sonic is rescued by  his friend miles prower alias tales and  manages to escape from robotnik's  clutches the two end up staying with  wade who happens to be a good friend and  colleague of tom they try to figure out  why exactly sonic is supposed to be the  key to the powerful master emerald  eventually sonic manages to convince  tails to track down the mysterious relic  which is far too powerful to fall into  wrong hands in parallel robotnik  contacts his assistant agent stone who  all this time was under the belief that  robotnik was dead likewise robotnik sets  out to find the emerald but of course  not to help knuckles but to claim the  stone's power for himself thanks to an  old map from sonic's mentor longclaw and  a compass the heroes get even closer to  the emerald however they are eventually  located by both robotnik and knuckles  and swept away by an avalanche sonic  succeeds in contacting tom in time and  so the two of them are saved at the very  last second by a portal ring in doing so  they burst into the midst of the wedding  ceremony which is not only embarrassing  but actually very dangerous it turns out  that not only the guests but also  rachel's fiancee are in truth undercover  agents of the gun they temporarily  arrest sonic tails and tom before they  can finally be freed by the heroic  efforts of maddie in the meantime  robotnik and knuckles find the emerald  in an underwater temple where the two  finally face off again during the combat  robotnik secretly escapes with the  emerald and absorbs its power now  knuckles also realizes that he was only  being used by robotnik and so from now  on he joined sonic and tales in the  fight against the evil doctor he has  meanwhile created a giant robot and is  destroying green hills the trio manages  to get the master emerald back although  it shatters into the seven chaos  emeralds after sonic through his new  form as supersonic is able to destroy  the robot and apparently robotnik as  well knuckles reassembles the seven  stones into one and the three new  friends live happily ever after in the  home of tom and maddie in a mid-credits  scene it is then revealed that robotnik  has disappeared without a trace the gun  encounters the secret project shadow and  the last thing we see is a black  hedgehog awakening in a research  facility  now that the main points of sonic the  hedgehog 2 have been summed up it is  time to turn our attention to the  follow-up in part three the sequel was  already confirmed in february which is  why the preparations should be in full  swing the starting point is clear we  have a trio of sonic tails and knuckles  and a disappear dr robotnik who  certainly has some things to sort out  with the three of them in the following  we introduce you to the most popular  theories on how sonic the hedgehog 3  could continue  as was already hard to miss in the  second part we will meet shadow the  hedgehog as the antagonist in the  upcoming movie as we already know thanks  to a statement from director jeff fowler  the timeline of the movies is not based  on the original sequence of the games in  terms of shadow this means that we will  quite likely get to know the story of  the gloomy character in more detail and  also delve a bit deeper into the overall  narrative of the sonic franchise that  would also mean that at least in  flashbacks we get to meet robotnik's  grandfather gerald and his granddaughter  maria the granddaughter is by the way  one of the few people shadow is not  hostile to but let's go back to the  beginning shadow originates from the  already mentioned project shadow which  was carried out about 50 years before  the events of sonic the hedgehog 2 in  the games this is a research program of  the united federation which is modeled  on today's united states and is the home  country of the military organization gun  the final product of this experiment  which was led by gerald are two  creatures that are almost immortal bio  lizard and shadow the hedgehog however  after the creation of shadow the same  name project was scrapped due to its  dangerous nature attempting to free  shadow maria robotnik was shot by a gun  soldier which in turn led her  grandfather gerald to become a villain  who sought to destroy the world for  revenge he was ultimately executed on  prison island though before doing so he  implanted his quest for revenge into  shadow the hedgehog as a result once  shadow was awakened the world  destruction plan that was programmed  into him begins to take its course at  this point we are just at the end of  sonic the hedgehog 2 and so the theory  that shadow will be the main antagonist  of the third movie is considered very  feasible  as we have unfortunately known for some  months jim carrey is left acting at the  age of almost 60. how final this  decision ultimately is cannot be said at  the moment but one thing is clear his  retirement from acting is probably a bad  omen for a sonic the hedgehog 3 which is  probably already in pre-production so  the question must be asked how to  replace the actor who for many carried  the film with his inimitable style a  popular theory has gained momentum since  the news of his end of acting and that  is one that favors an appearance by  metal sonic in the upcoming blockbuster  in short metal sonic is robotnik's  attempt to transfer sonic's powers into  a machine or rather a robot which he  succeeded in doing quite well thus he is  more or less a copy of the real sonic  only without the many human attributes  in addition metal sonic is definitely  one of sonic's strongest opponents and  unlike shadow who sometimes does show  human emotions he has a very clear and  personal goal to kill sonic therefore he  is a vicious adversary who as one of  robotnik's strongest creations does  credit to his inventor and could  worthily represent him in part three  besides knuckles and tails a character  from the games that is at least as well  known is amy rose she is not a villain  but rather a cheerful positive and  energetic hedgehog girl who has a crush  on sonic the first hints of her  appearance in sonic 3 came during a q a  with screenwriters patrick casey and  josh miller at the end of may there they  did not deny amy's presence as a popular  character in the third part and instead  they very openly stated that her  appearance was in the works it is  understandable that they were not able  to reveal much a few weeks after the  release of sonic the hedgehog 2 however  it is at least encouraging that there is  a chance of an appearance in the future  even though she sometimes has quite the  mood swings and is downright obsessed  with her great love sonic she would  surely energetically support the current  trio in the fight against shadow and the  likes despite her often innocent nature  she is quite the powerful ally who can  match her friends for example her main  weapon is the pico pico hammer which amy  uses to defend herself and which gets  bigger when she is angry  there is still little information about  the cast in production the return of ben  schwartz's sonic collino shaughnessy as  tails and idris elba as knuckles is  considered certain regarding jim carrey  as dr robotnik there is no reliable  information however many claim that he  will eventually take on the third part  while others take his departure from  acting as serious one thing is for sure  there will be no recasting of his  character under any circumstances as  producers toby asher and neil h moritz  have already pointed out it would also  be more than foolish to attempt to  recasting as it would cause a gigantic  [ __ ] storm instead several human actors  will almost certainly return including  james marsden and tikka sumter as tom  and maddie adam pally is wade whipple  and limash dube as a submissive robotnik  ally asian stone since the gun will  probably be playing a big role again we  can also imagine a return of tom butler  as commander walters shimar more as an  undercover agent and pseudohusband  randall and natasha rothwell is maddie's  sister rachel what remains even more  exciting is the casting of amy and  shadow whose appearances are more or  less assured the release date of the  animated spectacle was only recently  announced sonic the hedgehog 3 will hit  theaters in the us on december 20th 2024  and that's it for our original episode  how did you picture the upcoming sonic  the hedgehog 3 and which characters and  plot lines would you incorporate as a  scriptwriter feel free to let us know in  the comments  [Music]  you

